This product bundles third-party open-source software, each under its own
license. Notable runtime and build dependencies include (non-exhaustive):

- Go module dependencies listed in backend/go.mod (e.g. chi, pgx, jose/crypto
  libraries) - see their respective repositories for license terms.
- npm dependencies listed in package-lock.json and each workspace's
  package.json (e.g. Next.js, React, Yjs, Zustand, pdf.js, Zod) - see their
  respective repositories for license terms.
- Fonts used in designs are loaded at runtime from Google Fonts; none are
  redistributed in this repository.
- The interface font, Plus Jakarta Sans (Copyright 2020 The Plus Jakarta Sans
  Project Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1), is bundled with the app from the
  npm package @fontsource-variable/plus-jakarta-sans, whose license text ships
  in that package.

Bundled demo content:

- backend/internal/stock/stock.json contains a small demo/sample asset catalog.
  The photo entries (license type "placeholder") are served via Lorem Picsum and
  are NOT HyCanvas-owned assets; replace them with your own licensed media before
  production use. Icon entries are generated vectors and are covered by the
  project license.

Bundled models, colour engine and colour profiles:

- frontend/public/models/realesr-animevideov3.onnx is the Real-ESRGAN
  realesr-animevideov3 model (Copyright (c) 2021, Xintao Wang, BSD-3-Clause,
  github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN), converted to ONNX (tools/esr-convert). Its
  license text ships next to it as realesr-animevideov3.LICENSE.txt. It runs
  in the browser via onnxruntime-web (MIT) for Vectorize's Enhance step.
- frontend/public/vendor/lcms-wasm/ is lcms-wasm 1.0.5 (Copyright (c) 2024
  Matt DesLauriers, MIT), Little CMS (Copyright (c) Marti Maria Saguer, MIT)
  compiled to WebAssembly, used for CMYK colour conversion in print exports.
  Its license text ships next to it.
- frontend/public/icc/PSO_Uncoated_ISO12647_eci.icc is the PSO Uncoated
  ISO12647 profile of the European Color Initiative (www.eci.org), shipped
  unaltered; its own copyright tag permits use, embedding, exchange and
  sharing without restriction (see README.txt next to it). Other ECI profiles
  (e.g. PSO Coated v3) are not redistributed; workspaces upload them.

